## Step 3: Copy the Public Key to App Server 2

Repeat the process for the second server.

```bash
ssh-copy-id steve@stapp02
```

Again, authenticate using the password one final time. After this step, the `steve` user trusts the `thor` user’s private key.

---

<br>
<br>

## Step 4: Copy the Public Key to App Server 3

Repeat the same procedure for the third server.

```bash
ssh-copy-id banner@stapp03
```

At this stage, all three servers have the same public key installed.

