## Automating Across All Servers at Once

For learning purposes, multiple remote copies can be scripted.

```bash
for user in "tony@stapp01" "steve@stapp02" "banner@stapp03"; do
  ssh-copy-id $user
done
```

This demonstrates how easily SSH trust can scale once the concept is understood.

